       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. HELLO.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 A PIC 9(4) VALUE 12.
       01 B PIC 9(4) VALUE 30.
       01 C PIC 9(5).
       01 NAME PIC X(10) VALUE "WORLD".
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN.
           DISPLAY "HELLO, " NAME.
           ADD A TO B GIVING C.
           DISPLAY "SUM=" C.
           IF C > 40 DISPLAY "BIG" ELSE DISPLAY "SMALL" END-IF.
           PERFORM 3 TIMES DISPLAY "X" END-PERFORM.
           STOP RUN.
